scene canvas.osn
alike
window 320 240

# The torus onto an empty canvas. The package's canvas preset and its
# plain one are the same Kernels and draw the same surface, every word
# to the bit, on every backend.
frame 0.0
expect apart.result[0] = 0
# The fast path picks the same triangle at every pixel on the
# interpreter and the JIT; on a GPU the device's rasterizer takes an edge
# pixel the other way now and then, fifteen of some thirty thousand here.
expect differ.result[0] <= 64
expect drawn.result[0] = 30322
